{"action":"send","subject":"Bearing bracket HN – closing proposal","body":"Dear Marek,

Thank you for your final offer and for the steps you have taken. We are close and can confirm today if you can meet us at EUR 44.33 per unit, with 800 ppm, no complaint chargeback and all fixed enquiry terms unchanged, including 60-day payment. This further move closes the gap fairly for both sides while retaining your preferred structure.

Hollerau Pumpenwerke, Purchasing","offers":["A"],"rationale":"Marek has declared his final offer and retained 800 ppm with no chargebacks. The single probe package makes a substantial closing price move without changing fixed payment terms or reopening arguments."}
